{"id":"7574b9b4eeb0657b","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-model-characterization.md","title":"条件模型的纤维函子扩张","display":"thm-model-characterization — 条件模型的纤维函子扩张","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"3","label":"16-thm-model-characterization","aliases":["16-thm-model-characterization","16-thm--model-characterization"],"display":"thm-model-characterization — 条件模型的纤维函子扩张","depends_on":["[[16-df-equational-fibred-model]]"],"review_status":"resolved-source-corrected-extension-theorem","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J12","review_date":"2026-10-20","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-reviewed; local-construction-reviewed-not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_date":"2026-10-20","source":"Theorem 3.6.3, pp.210–211 (PDF230–231)","previous_review_boundary":"缺少分类Eq-fibration、条件模型及同构唯一扩张接口；历史模型范畴等价未获证明。","current_review_boundary":"原书Theorem3.6.3的固定基模型扩张和垂直同构唯一性；未断言未经构造的两个完整模型范畴等价。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-model-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-model-characterization</span><span>16-thm--model-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-model-characterization — 条件模型的纤维函子扩张"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"22039ebbb905273f\" href=\"?note=22039ebbb905273f\" title=\"16-df-equational-fibred-model\">16-df-equational-fibred-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"resolved-source-corrected-extension-theorem"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J12"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-reviewed; local-construction-reviewed-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem 3.6.3, pp.210–211 (PDF230–231)"},{"key":"previous_review_boundary","html":"缺少分类Eq-fibration、条件模型及同构唯一扩张接口；历史模型范畴等价未获证明。"},{"key":"current_review_boundary","html":"原书Theorem3.6.3的固定基模型扩张和垂直同构唯一性；未断言未经构造的两个完整模型范畴等价。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,H,p_H:\\mathcal E_H\\to\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma,H,p_H:\\mathcal E_H\\to\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M:\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(M:\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi^M\">\\(\\Phi^M\\)</span> 及谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibModel},\\mathrm{ExtEq},\\mathrm{VIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibModel},\\mathrm{ExtEq},\\mathrm{VIso}\\)</span> 均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"22039ebbb905273f\" href=\"?note=22039ebbb905273f\" title=\"16-df-equational-fibred-model\">16-df-equational-fibred-model</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是其中的签名模型。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(\\Gamma,\\Theta)\">\\(a=(\\Gamma,\\Theta)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(\\Delta,\\Lambda)\">\\(b=(\\Delta,\\Lambda)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_H\">\\(\\mathcal E_H\\)</span> 的对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\">\\(f=\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\\)</span> 为箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_M\">\\(L_M\\)</span> 为以下仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\\)</span> 成立时构造的函子，箭头分支由所列唯一图给出；此时不预先假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_M\">\\(L_M\\)</span> 存在。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists L)\\ \\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists L)\\ \\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(L_M)_0(\\Gamma,\\Theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Phi^M_\\Gamma(\\Theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall a,b\\in O_H)\n(\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathbf C_\\Sigma(p_Ha,p_Hb))\\\\\n&amp;\\left[\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\\in M_H\\Longrightarrow\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal E((L_M)_0a,(L_M)_0b))\\ ph=M\\rho\\right],\\\\\n(L_M)_1(f)=h&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow h\\in\\mathcal E((L_M)_0a,(L_M)_0b)\\land ph=M\\rho,\\\\\nL_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(L_M)_0,(L_M)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(L_M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(L)\\land\\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(K)\n\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;(\\exists!\\eta)\\ \\mathrm{VIso}_{M,p}(L,K;\\eta).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(L_M)_0(\\Gamma,\\Theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Phi^M_\\Gamma(\\Theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall a,b\\in O_H)\n(\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathbf C_\\Sigma(p_Ha,p_Hb))\\\\\n&amp;\\left[\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\\in M_H\\Longrightarrow\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal E((L_M)_0a,(L_M)_0b))\\ ph=M\\rho\\right],\\\\\n(L_M)_1(f)=h&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow h\\in\\mathcal E((L_M)_0a,(L_M)_0b)\\land ph=M\\rho,\\\\\nL_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(L_M)_0,(L_M)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(L_M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(L)\\land\\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(K)\n\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;(\\exists!\\eta)\\ \\mathrm{VIso}_{M,p}(L,K;\\eta).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源为Jacobs 1999 Theorem3.6.3，印刷210–211，PDF230–231；本轮核对原文陈述、证明及PDF231图像。原书证明“基模型满足公理，当且仅当它扩张为保持Eq结构的纤维函子，扩张在同构意义下唯一”。旧稿写成两个未定义完整模型范畴的等价，且错误依赖DTT的UniversalModel和仅适用Set的Pred，既不能从原书陈述直接得到，也没有给出范畴及2胞腔。本页恢复原书有明确证明的扩张定理，并未把旧范畴等价当作已证结论保留。</p>\n<p>可靠性按条件等式的有限推导树归纳：等式的自反、对称、传递、替换来自Eq-fibration的对角伴随、Frobenius和参数BC；函数同余由项解释和等式的函数相容得到。弱化为有限meet投影，cut为复合，项代入为重索引并使用项解释的替换引理。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\le^H_\\Gamma\\Lambda[\\rho]\">\\(\\Theta\\le^H_\\Gamma\\Lambda[\\rho]\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi^M_\\Gamma\\Theta\\le (M\\rho)^*\\Phi^M_\\Delta\\Lambda\">\\(\\Phi^M_\\Gamma\\Theta\\le (M\\rho)^*\\Phi^M_\\Delta\\Lambda\\)</span>。其笛卡尔提升给箭头图中的存在性；预序纤维使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 忠实，给唯一性，也立即给函子律。</p>\n<p>空列表与拼接的解释是纤维终对象与积；替换的解释由参数BC与重索引保积给垂直同构，所以该函子保持笛卡尔箭头。分类纤维化的等式左伴随由“弱化原假设并添加复制变量相等”构造；其解释由目标的Frobenius给等式伴随mate可逆。结合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 保积，故得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFibMor}(M,L_M;p_H,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFibMor}(M,L_M;p_H,p)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>反向：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 保持纤维积与Eq，把每个单等式对象送至对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq}_p(Ms,Mt)\">\\(\\operatorname{Eq}_p(Ms,Mt)\\)</span> 的垂直同构类。每条公理在分类纤维化中是同一底对象上从假设列表到结论单等式的箭头，因此其像正给模型有效性。任意对象为单等式的有限meet，所以任何扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"La\\cong\\Phi^M_\\Gamma\\Theta\">\\(La\\cong\\Phi^M_\\Gamma\\Theta\\)</span>。在预序纤维内此垂直同构唯一；其自然性由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 忠实得到。两扩张于是有唯一垂直自然同构，空列表和空语境同样成立。</p>\n<p>J12的原始缺口现由两个本书内的新定义闭合。所有新增结构均有构造，不以“存在扩张”定义“满足公理”；证明未经Coq/Rocq等机器检查。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-equational-fibred-model","status":"resolved","id":"22039ebbb905273f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-equational-fibred-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-equational-fibred-model","status":"resolved","id":"22039ebbb905273f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,H,p_H:\\mathcal E_H\\to\\mathbf C_\\Sigma$、$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$、$M:\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal B$、$\\Phi^M$ 及谓词 $\\mathrm{FibModel},\\mathrm{ExtEq},\\mathrm{VIso}$ 均采用 [[16-df-equational-fibred-model]]；$M$ 是其中的签名模型。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,H,p_H:\\mathcal E_H\\to\\mathbf C_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"M:\\mathbf C_\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi^M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibModel},\\mathrm{ExtEq},\\mathrm{VIso}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"a=(\\Gamma,\\Theta)","display":false},{"tex":"b=(\\Delta,\\Lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_H","display":false},{"tex":"f=\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"L_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)","display":false},{"tex":"L_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists L)\\ \\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(L).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(L_M)_0(\\Gamma,\\Theta)&\\coloneqq\\Phi^M_\\Gamma(\\Theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\\Longrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall a,b\\in O_H)\n(\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathbf C_\\Sigma(p_Ha,p_Hb))\\\\\n&\\left[\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\\in M_H\\Longrightarrow\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal E((L_M)_0a,(L_M)_0b))\\ ph=M\\rho\\right],\\\\\n(L_M)_1(f)=h&\\Longleftrightarrow h\\in\\mathcal E((L_M)_0a,(L_M)_0b)\\land ph=M\\rho,\\\\\nL_M&\\coloneqq\\langle(L_M)_0,(L_M)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)\\Longrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(L_M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(L)\\land\\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(K)\n\\Longrightarrow{}&(\\exists!\\eta)\\ \\mathrm{VIso}_{M,p}(L,K;\\eta).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Theta\\le^H_\\Gamma\\Lambda[\\rho]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi^M_\\Gamma\\Theta\\le (M\\rho)^*\\Phi^M_\\Delta\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqFibMor}(M,L_M;p_H,p)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eq}_p(Ms,Mt)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"La\\cong\\Phi^M_\\Gamma\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":4532,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]、[[16-df-equational-derivation]]、[[16-df-algebraic-category]]、[[16-thm-algebraic-category]]、[[16-df-algebraic-model]]、[[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]、[[16-lem-lawvere]]、[[16-thm-completeness-eq]]。条件等式现有本书内分类纤维化和模型扩张构造，见 [[16-df-equational-classifying-fibration]]、[[16-df-equational-fibred-model]]、[[16-thm-model-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["22039ebbb905273f"]}